@MarketPlace_HostAddress = http://localhost:5008

### Listar categorías (seed)
GET {{MarketPlace_HostAddress}}/api/categories
Accept: application/json

###

### Listar unidades de medida (seed)
GET {{MarketPlace_HostAddress}}/api/units-of-measure
Accept: application/json

###

### Registrar agricultor
POST {{MarketPlace_HostAddress}}/api/farmer-profiles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "farmName": "Finca El Porvenir",
  "description": "Hortalizas orgánicas de la sabana",
  "verificationStatus": "Pending",
  "bankAccountInfo": "Banco Agrario 1234-5678"
}

###

### Publicar producto
POST {{MarketPlace_HostAddress}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "farmerProfileId": "REEMPLAZAR_CON_ID_AGRICULTOR",
  "categoryId": 1,
  "unitOfMeasureId": 1,
  "name": "Manzana Roja",
  "description": "Manzanas frescas de la finca",
  "unitPrice": 3500,
  "stockQuantity": 100,
  "isOrganic": 1,
  "harvestDate": "2026-07-30"
}

###

### Crear orden de compra (con dirección de envío y entrega)
POST {{MarketPlace_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "farmerProfileId": "REEMPLAZAR_CON_ID_AGRICULTOR",
  "streetAddress": "Calle 10 # 5-20",
  "municipality": "Chía",
  "department": "Cundinamarca",
  "additionalDetails": "Casa esquinera, portón verde",
  "deliveryType": "DirectHomeDelivery",
  "estimatedDeliveryDate": "2026-08-02",
  "notes": "Entregar en la tarde",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "REEMPLAZAR_CON_ID_PRODUCTO",
      "quantity": 2
    }
  ]
}

###

### Consultar detalle de una orden (incluye datos de entrega)
GET {{MarketPlace_HostAddress}}/api/orders/REEMPLAZAR_CON_ID_ORDEN
Accept: application/json

###

### Cambiar estado de la orden
PATCH {{MarketPlace_HostAddress}}/api/orders/REEMPLAZAR_CON_ID_ORDEN/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Preparing"
}

###

### Actualizar datos de entrega (fecha real, notas)
PATCH {{MarketPlace_HostAddress}}/api/orders/REEMPLAZAR_CON_ID_ORDEN/delivery
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "estimatedDeliveryDate": "2026-08-02",
  "deliveredAt": "2026-08-02",
  "notes": "Entregado al consumidor"
}

###

### Registrar reseña de producto
POST {{MarketPlace_HostAddress}}/api/products/REEMPLAZAR_CON_ID_PRODUCTO/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rating": 5,
  "comment": "Excelente calidad y frescura"
}

###

### Reseñas y promedio de un producto
GET {{MarketPlace_HostAddress}}/api/products/REEMPLAZAR_CON_ID_PRODUCTO/reviews
Accept: application/json

###

### Recomendaciones con IA (integración Groq)
POST {{MarketPlace_HostAddress}}/api/ai/recommendations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "Recomiéndame frutas frescas para esta semana"
}

###
